{"id":"949971542089df67","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-largecard2-almost-huge-cardinal.md","title":"ZFC Largecard2 Almost Huge Cardinal","display":"df-zfc-largecard2-almost-huge-cardinal — ZFC Largecard2 Almost Huge Cardinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-largecard2-almost-huge-cardinal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-largecard2-almost-huge-cardinal","58-df-zfc-largecard4-almost-huge-cardinal"],"display":"df-zfc-largecard2-almost-huge-cardinal — ZFC Largecard2 Almost Huge Cardinal","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-largecard2-almost-huge-cardinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-largecard2-almost-huge-cardinal</span><span>58-df-zfc-largecard4-almost-huge-cardinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-largecard2-almost-huge-cardinal — ZFC Largecard2 Almost Huge Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (cardinal candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2AlmostHugeCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2AlmostHugeCardinal}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists^{\\mathsf{Cls}}\">\\(\\exists^{\\mathsf{Cls}}\\)</span> is the metatheoretic class-existential quantifier</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TransitiveClass}(M)\">\\(\\operatorname{TransitiveClass}(M)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ClassFunction}(j,V,M)\">\\(\\operatorname{ClassFunction}(j,V,M)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ClassElemEmb}(j,V,M)\">\\(\\operatorname{ClassElemEmb}(j,V,M)\\)</span> are metatheoretic predicates; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> here are classes, not set codes</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{crit}(j)\">\\(\\operatorname{crit}(j)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M^{&lt;j(\\kappa)}\\subseteq M\">\\(M^{&lt;j(\\kappa)}\\subseteq M\\)</span> are likewise interpreted in the class metatheory</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard2\\text{-}almost\\text{-}huge\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2AlmostHugeCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\n\\exists^{\\mathsf{Cls}}M\\;\\exists^{\\mathsf{Cls}}j\\;\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{TransitiveClass}(M)\\land\n\\operatorname{ClassFunction}(j,V,M)\\land\n\\operatorname{ClassElemEmb}(j,V,M)\\land\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\kappa\\land\nM^{&lt;j(\\kappa)}\\subseteq M\n\\bigr)\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard2\\text{-}almost\\text{-}huge\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2AlmostHugeCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\n\\exists^{\\mathsf{Cls}}M\\;\\exists^{\\mathsf{Cls}}j\\;\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{TransitiveClass}(M)\\land\n\\operatorname{ClassFunction}(j,V,M)\\land\n\\operatorname{ClassElemEmb}(j,V,M)\\land\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\kappa\\land\nM^{&lt;j(\\kappa)}\\subseteq M\n\\bigr)\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is explicitly a class-level schema. Its quantifiers range over the declared metatheoretic class domain, rather than using prose inside the formal assertion.</li>\n<li>The set-coded <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\\)</span> predicate cannot accept the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>, so using it here would conflate object and metalevels.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-largecard4-almost-huge-cardinal</code> is merged here; it used the same almost-huge closure condition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2AlmostHugeCardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists^{\\mathsf{Cls}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TransitiveClass}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ClassFunction}(j,V,M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ClassElemEmb}(j,V,M)","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{crit}(j)","display":false},{"tex":"M^{<j(\\kappa)}\\subseteq M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard2\\text{-}almost\\text{-}huge\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2AlmostHugeCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\n\\exists^{\\mathsf{Cls}}M\\;\\exists^{\\mathsf{Cls}}j\\;\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{TransitiveClass}(M)\\land\n\\operatorname{ClassFunction}(j,V,M)\\land\n\\operatorname{ClassElemEmb}(j,V,M)\\land\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\kappa\\land\nM^{<j(\\kappa)}\\subseteq M\n\\bigr)\n\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":1960,"backlinks":[{"id":"54c046b8706de870","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2AlmostHugeCardinal}_S$ (upstream class-level almost-huge scheme, see [[58-df-zfc-largecard2-almost-huge-cardinal]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2413","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-largecard2-almost-huge-cardinal.md|58-df-zfc-largecard2-almost-huge-cardinal]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5fb1c2241d1943d1"]}